name: occt-corresponding-source
mode: vendored
org: Saimek-AI
role: |
  LGPL-2.1 Corresponding Source for the OpenCASCADE (OCCT) WebAssembly module that Saimek
  distributes, in compiled form, inside Saimek3D. A compliance artifact, not a product:
  third-party source vendored verbatim under `occt/`, plus the `build-recipe/` that ties
  the shipped binary to that source (opencascade.js + replicad-opencascadejs 0.23.0).
notes: |
  PUBLIC by necessity — LGPL-2.1 puts the obligation to supply Corresponding Source on the
  distributor, which is Saimek. The bytes live here rather than behind an upstream link
  that can rot when a tag is renamed or a snapshot removed.

  Nothing here is written or owned by Saimek, and it is not maintained as a product. Do
  NOT update, refactor or tidy the vendored tree: its entire value is that it corresponds,
  by measured sha256, to the WASM actually shipped — `2e07c45b…` matched exactly one file
  across all 27 published versions of replicad-opencascadejs (`src/replicad_single.wasm`
  in 0.23.0). Changing it breaks the compliance chain the README documents.
